| Input | Output |
|---|---|
| `'  hi  '` | `'hi'` |
| `''` / `'   '` | `null` |
| `0`, `false` | preserved as-is |
| `{ k: undefined }` | key `k` omitted |
| `[undefined, null]` | kept in array |
| nested objects/arrays | handled recursively |

