    "next_after": null,
    "has_more": false,
    "limit": 50
  }
}
```

## Request parameters

| Param | Default | Constraints |
|---|---|---|
| `limit` | 50 | 1–200 (clamped) |
| `after` | *(none — start from newest)* | opaque cursor from a prior `next_after` |

